https://docs.ollama.com/integrations/pi

=C2=A0
Ollama can now launch Pi =
[https://pi.dev/], the coding agent that powers OpenClaw.
=C2=A0
Pi is designed to be a minimal coding harness that can be adapted to your =
workflows to create your own coding agent.
=C2=A0
Pi comes bundled with =
powerful primitives to build on, and can be extended with extensions =
[https://pi.dev/packages], skills,
prompt templates, and themes.
=C2=A0


Get started

Start by downloading the latest version of Ollama:
=C2=A0

Download Ollama [https://ollama.com/download]

=C2=A0
Next, use Ollama to launch Pi with a model (e.g. Kimi-K2.5). This installs =
Pi and configures Ollama as a provider including web
tools and multimodal support:
=C2=A0
ollama launch pi --model kimi-k2.=
5:cloud
=C2=A0


Customize Pi

All Pi packages [https://pi.dev/packages] =
work with Pi & Ollama, making it infinitely customizable for different =
tasks and use
cases.
=C2=A0
Subagents
For tasks that involve multiple =
agents like deep research or large codebase refactors, use pi-subagents:
=C2=A0
pi install npm:pi-subagents
=C2=A0
Autoresearch
Inspired by Andrej Karpathy=E2=80=99s Autoresearch, the pi-autoresearch =
extension gives Pi the tools and workflow to run autonomous
optimization loops to solve hard problems:
=C2=A0
pi install https://github=
.com/davebcn87/pi-autoresearch
=C2=A0
Once installed, run ollama launch pi =
then start a loop with /autoresearch:
=C2=A0
/autoresearch optimize test =
runtime and monitor correctness
=C2=A0


Works with local and cloud models

Pi=E2=80=99s minimal footprint makes it a great fit for running models on =
your own machine with Ollama. For harder tasks, your Ollama
account includes access to larger models on Ollama=E2=80=99s cloud.
=C2=A0
For additional usage, Ollama=E2=80=99s Pro and Max [https://ollama.=
com/pricing] plans are available:
=C2=A0

Upgrade Ollama [https://ollama.=
com/upgrade]

=C2=A0
If you have any feedback, please directly reply to =
this email or join Ollama's Discord channel
[https://discord.=
com/invite/ollama].
=C2=A0
=E2=9D=A4=EF=B8=8F Ollama
